%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec4ba6a512adabf4b8a74985cb2f4d14, type: 3}
  m_Name: SoldierDay1Dialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptedDialogue
  nodes:
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Another new face. Third one this month. How long before you wash out?
    animationTrigger: TalkCocky
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Three tours. Done the real thing. Every time I pass through a post like
      this — same scene. Fresh uniform, no idea what's coming.
    animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: What did they actually prep you for in training?
    animationTrigger: TalkSarcasticNod
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: The basics. Enough to do the job.
      npcResponse: The basics stop applying real fast out here. Trust me on that.
      animationTrigger: TalkDismissing
    - playerChoiceText: Guess we'll find out.
      npcResponse: Ha. Honest. Doesn't mean you'll last, but at least you know it.
      animationTrigger: TalkShrug
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Three days. That's my read. Most don't make it past the first week anyway.
    animationTrigger: TalkDismissing
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Last officer they put here? Sharp guy. Two weeks in, something came through
      that didn't add up. He flagged it. Nobody listened. Never came back.
    animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Trust your gut. When something feels wrong, don't wait for permission.
      By the time someone agrees with you, it's usually—
    animationTrigger: TalkPoint
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
